# Google Sheets Export (optional - choose ONE of the two options below)
# 
# Option 1 (Recommended for Docker): Paste the entire JSON key content as a single line
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY={"type":"service_account","project_id":"your-project",...}
#
# Option 2 (For local development): Path to the JSON key file
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY_FILE=/path/to/service-account-key.json
#
# Setup steps:
# 1. Create a Google Cloud project: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable Google Sheets API
# 3. Create a service account and download the JSON key file
# 4. Share your target spreadsheet with the service account email (found in the JSON file)
# 5. Use Option 1 (paste JSON content) or Option 2 (file path) above

